<title>TURKEY: Turkish March trade gap up 101 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Turkish March trade gap up 101 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's trade deficit rose by 101 percent to $1.64 billion in March from $818 million in the same 1995 month, the State Institute of Statistics said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
